{"id":"n73353-10-9","stage":0,"title":"내리다 · 卸下","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73353-10-9-1","ko":"아저씨, 이삿짐들을 이 문 앞에 내려 주세요.","zh":"大叔，请把搬家的东西卸在这个门前。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아저씨,","meaning":"大叔，叔叔","explanation":"아저씨：大叔，叔叔","readings":[{"term":"아저씨","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26237","senseId":"2","lemma":"아저씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이삿짐들을","meaning":"搬家的东西","explanation":"이삿짐：搬家的东西；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이삿짐","audio":"/audio/2ad758f1225008c20bed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71996","senseId":"1","lemma":"이삿짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문","meaning":"门","explanation":"문：门","readings":[{"term":"문","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43832","senseId":"1","lemma":"문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내려","meaning":"卸下，放下","explanation":"내리다：卸下，放下；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"10","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"14cf4d2fee0defcf","term":"아저씨","zh":"大叔，叔叔","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3","entryId":"26237","definition":"陌生人之间用于指称或称呼没有老的成年男子。","pronunciation":["아저씨"]},{"id":"2ad758f1225008c2","term":"이삿짐","zh":"搬家的东西","audio":"/audio/2ad758f1225008c20bed.mp3","entryId":"71996","definition":"搬家时搬运的行李。","pronunciation":["이사찜","이삳찜"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e2c7d5c49b61f532","term":"문","zh":"门","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3","entryId":"43832","definition":"为了能让人出入或能拿放东西而制作的可以开关的设施。","pronunciation":["문"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"卸下，放下","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"将上面的东西放到下面来。","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea04e0f91d1ae9336a59.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73353-10-9-2","ko":"네. 그럼 여기에 짐들을 놔두겠습니다.","zh":"好，那我把东西放在这里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짐들을","meaning":"行李，货物","explanation":"짐：行李，货物；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71357","senseId":"1","lemma":"짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놔두겠습니다.","meaning":"放下，放到","explanation":"놔두다：放下，放到；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"놔두다","audio":"/audio/dd6de8f290629bc419d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28326","senseId":"1","lemma":"놔두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"3d95bbb883f1e751","term":"짐","zh":"行李，货物","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3","entryId":"71357","definition":"为搬到他处而打包的物品。","pronunciation":["짐"]},{"id":"dd6de8f290629bc4","term":"놔두다","zh":"放下，放到","audio":"/audio/dd6de8f290629bc419d9.mp3","entryId":"28326","definition":"把拿在手里的东西置于某个地方。","pronunciation":["놔ː두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2889531d791d19cbe902.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.068,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73353","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"10","sourceLevel":"초급","day":28,"sequenceScore":1.2535,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好，那我把东西放在这里。","大叔，请把搬家的东西卸在这个门前。","怎么这么不平衡？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["大叔，请把搬家的东西卸在这个门前。","怎么这么不平衡？","好，那我把东西放在这里。"],"answer":2}]}
